        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 5059RAKN, R-Bar Knurled Lever with Round Disk Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Knurled Lever with Round Rose features the R-Bar Stem for a uniquely retro feel perfect for transitional homes. The  R-Bar Knurled Lever with Round Disk Rosette is available in all the hottest finish color options. Choose from dummy, passage, or privacy functions for all of your interior door applications. The R-Bar Knurled Door Lever with Disk Rose has a textured grip that has been on trend this season.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-RA-Specifications.gif?v=1704354617\" width=\"600\" height=\"163\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Emtek R-Bar Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the R-Bar Knurled Door Lever with Disk Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li>Lever is surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face).</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass lever and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Knurled R-BAR Leverset with Round Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4 - 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-RA-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262419\"><b>Emtek Select R-Bar Lever Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door levers on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nLevers are Handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-levers-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354533\" width=\"599\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Knurled Lever with Round Rose",
                "description": "The Knurled Lever with Round Rose features the R-Bar Stem for a uniquely retro feel perfect for transitional homes. The  R-Bar Knurled Lever with Round Disk Rosette is available in all the hottest finish color options. Choose from dummy, passage, or privacy functions for all of your interior door applications. The R-Bar Knurled Door Lever with Disk Rose has a textured grip that has been on trend this season.",
